<h2 local-id=3D"0a9213a63864" id=3D"AutomatedRenewalsRequirements-2.Request=
Summary">2. Request Summary</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"c=
924ccc6-bdfe-492f-ac19-3721bdc7f287" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"831bfd47-4e23-4305-81cf-cc32822525f1">
<th data-local-id=3D"42a74393-4ac1-488e-b0e7-b011a6936708" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"8d1e15c9089f">Category</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"39320727-bf66-432e-9bca-499b55021d99" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"9f036837a8db">Details</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b34b8eb6-8ea6-4f70-9d10-5b09624497c0">
<td data-local-id=3D"e6369d7f-9739-40f5-8d26-725ce9cb200e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"269ec71f871f">Business Need</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ee6aacc7-dc2d-4866-944b-3a68f45962dc" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"31d8977acab5">Automate renewal processing by creating renewa=
l quotes automatically (at least 90 days before contract expiration) and op=
tionally delivering those quotes automatically, with control/override capab=
ility and alignment to invoice creation/flow to Workday. <a class=3D"extern=
al-link" href=3D"https://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_gue=
nther_helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A9=
8-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20=
Salesforce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofo=
llow">[Renewals R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"74e4b463-220b-4530-926c-3da2024eafef">
<td data-local-id=3D"ba1376a1-60f8-4751-bb10-c5c65dca536b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f1d10cb72b95">Why This Is Needed Now</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"40fd31ce-6cf5-43d0-8c5d-4be7df9fe4a7" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"09f3894afc26">The team is approaching a July 20 go-live date=
 and needs requirements defined for UAT and build decisions, including auto=
-renewal workflow timing and controls. <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"h=
ttps://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystems_=
com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505A=
B%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&am=
p;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R.=
..Salesforce | Word]</a></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9d218ec9-30ea-486b-a301-da723b405734">
<td data-local-id=3D"fc3bcbfb-5cf8-46a0-9d1e-dfe2a85e12e0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5b217d734cfc">Who Is Impacted</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d6334113-fc89-4b13-b81a-ca4641727b89" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6d9a2ac86aed">Customer Operations (Tech), Renewal Specialist=
s / Customer Cyber Operations; Cyber Operations users supporting auto-renew=
al brands. <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://helpsystemsllc-my.sha=
repoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sou=
rcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20R=
equirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobil=
eredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p>=
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"64a761caced1" id=3D"AutomatedRenewalsRequirements-3.Scope">=
3. Scope</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"2=
f26dbae-67c5-4c01-abe6-8bee3ab841fe" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"97eed2e2-f187-40ca-a67e-e79a5a901e75">
<th data-local-id=3D"869d02cf-30c9-4bc1-b998-6ef289afbca9" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"882ec7ba6fda">Scope Type</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"a466c671-4feb-4434-90d2-a298de3cf459" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"f6904e9998ac">Details</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"fff88e54-d419-4f5a-a729-2922a1df3453">
<td data-local-id=3D"64d6fcc0-b5e9-4a4d-b6ca-d524f413deb4" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4fb2dbc833dd">In Scope</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"724f8d36-6e9a-4377-9d69-bdf373d4dc19" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c51b0268333f">Auto-creation of renewal quotes; rules for tim=
ing (e.g., 90 days); ability to auto-deliver quotes based on a solution-lev=
el default with contract-level override; scheduling approach that supports =
a review window between quote creation and delivery; considerations for dow=
nstream order activation leading toward invoicing. <a class=3D"external-lin=
k" href=3D"https://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_=
helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9=
-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesf=
orce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">=
[Renewals R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"38197ff2-c198-4abf-9778-95a3580fdd29">
<td data-local-id=3D"7bb5dff6-116d-439c-8671-b344168f0104" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a54043686d99">Out of Scope</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f8b28aaf-1e91-475c-98c3-7872edffb61b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c6c66cb5fd2e">Detailed cancel/rebill design and tax recalcul=
ation process; final decisions on quote expiration logic; exact go-live pha=
sing decisions (e.g., first-month manual review period) beyond capturing th=
e requirement for a configurable control. <a class=3D"external-link" href=
=3D"https://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsys=
tems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64B=
D505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.do=
cx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewa=
ls R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"0be1c522191d" id=3D"AutomatedRenewalsRequirements-4.Functio=
nalRequirements">4. Functional Requirements</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"1d21e088-0cd9-477f-a1c1-0726cac8d4bb">
<li local-id=3D"cac3db64-5b7f-4395-9700-9db3c390ba22">
<p local-id=3D"5ea7ccce424a"><strong>FR-1:</strong> The system must automat=
ically create renewal quotes at least <strong>90 days prior to contract exp=
iration</strong>. <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://helpsystemsllc=
-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.a=
spx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenew=
als%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefault&am=
p;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R...Salesforce | Word]<=
/a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a8ae852b-07ee-4e54-a531-06eef793cf32">
<p local-id=3D"391548bb03a7"><strong>FR-2:</strong> The system must support=
 an option to <strong>automatically deliver (send) renewal quotes</strong>,=
 controlled by a <strong>solution-level</strong> setting. <a class=3D"exter=
nal-link" href=3D"https://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_gu=
enther_helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A=
98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%2=
0Salesforce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nof=
ollow">[Renewals R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bdfd9fa2-296e-41fe-8363-5e933b97b1a4">
<p local-id=3D"ea047bcf3b0b"><strong>FR-3:</strong> The system must allow a=
uthorized users to <strong>override</strong> the solution-level auto-delive=
ry behavior <strong>at the contract level</strong>. <a class=3D"external-li=
nk" href=3D"https://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther=
_helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A=
9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Sales=
force.docx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow"=
>[Renewals R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"57939628-e964-405b-b720-469aaa111caf">
<p local-id=3D"6c34cdf2c4c2"><strong>FR-4:</strong> The system must schedul=
e quote automation such that there is <strong>1=E2=80=932 business days</st=
rong> between quote creation and quote delivery to allow customer operation=
s review/adjustment before sending. <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"http=
s://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystems_com=
/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7=
D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&amp;a=
ction=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R...S=
alesforce | Word]</a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b8f0f649-3790-462c-888f-e1489b388851">
<p local-id=3D"c2e4e792300a"><strong>FR-5:</strong> The system must support=
 a <strong>manual/batched delivery mechanism</strong> (e.g., selecting up t=
o ~200 records in a list view) to release quotes when auto-delivery is not =
enabled or during an initial stabilization period. <a class=3D"external-lin=
k" href=3D"https://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_=
helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9=
-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesf=
orce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">=
[Renewals R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"60ce077c-ed7d-4dc9-9505-1029908bc6b1">
<p local-id=3D"f6fdb44285ae"><strong>FR-6:</strong> The renewal workflow mu=
st include the ability to convert an auto-created quote into an <strong>ord=
er</strong>, and <strong>activate</strong> the order as the end of the Sale=
sforce renewal process (prior to invoicing in Workday). <a class=3D"externa=
l-link" href=3D"https://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guen=
ther_helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98=
-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20S=
alesforce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofol=
low">[Renewals R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"46eb7b3d1440" id=3D"AutomatedRenewalsRequirements-5.Busines=
sRules">5. Business Rules</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"c1c3f077-e1ad-4db7-963a-4efa4039fd3e">
<li local-id=3D"841f647b-2356-49c9-ad25-481ae6fa87fb">
<p local-id=3D"551fb9223cd9"><strong>BR-1:</strong> Auto-delivery of renewa=
l quotes must <strong>default based on solution</strong>, with contract-lev=
el override permitted for authorized users. <a class=3D"external-link" href=
=3D"https://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsys=
tems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64B=
D505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.do=
cx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewa=
ls R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2f31c306-52f1-4b8b-ab0e-df0a8ab9822b">
<p local-id=3D"1c774e2505d3"><strong>BR-2:</strong> Quote creation may occu=
r on the <strong>1st of the month regardless of day</strong>, but quote del=
ivery should occur at the <strong>end of the first or second business day</=
strong> (to allow review time). <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://=
helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystems_com/_la=
youts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&am=
p;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&amp;actio=
n=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R...Sales=
force | Word]</a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"26526977-e95b-42eb-9235-77f459bbcf90">
<p local-id=3D"6123bc442531"><strong>BR-3:</strong> Only users in <strong>C=
ustomer Operations</strong> (including renewal specialist/customer cyber op=
erations roles) may override contract-level auto-delivery behavior. <a clas=
s=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/person=
al/leah_guenther_helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC=
40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathe=
ring%20-%20Salesforce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" =
rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p></li>
</ul>
