<h2 local-id=3D"002d6eada3b0" id=3D"AutomatedRenewalsRequirements-10.Accept=
anceCriteria">10. Acceptance Criteria</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"6dc94fbc-8d02-46f2-a999-46b4882ad795">
<li local-id=3D"1cd2a3c7-9652-41d2-9c2c-cff618bd6131">
<p local-id=3D"d89fe2d9b32f"><strong>AC-1:</strong> Given a contract expiri=
ng on date X, a renewal quote is automatically created no later than <stron=
g>X-90 days</strong>. <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://helpsystem=
sllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/D=
oc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DR=
enewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefaul=
t&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R...Salesforce | Wo=
rd]</a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4f7042d9-d1bb-4179-a262-e02ee406c908">
<p local-id=3D"9ecda3a145ab"><strong>AC-2:</strong> When solution-level aut=
o-delivery is enabled, the quote is delivered on the configured schedule, a=
llowing <strong>at least 1 business day and no more than 2 business days</s=
trong> after creation. <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://helpsyste=
msllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helpsystems_com/_layouts/15/=
Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B64BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3D=
Renewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.docx&amp;action=3Ddefau=
lt&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Renewals R...Salesforce | W=
ord]</a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"74a454f0-0cb5-4048-81ff-fb1b3dfb9215">
<p local-id=3D"82bf38947af4"><strong>AC-3:</strong> An authorized Customer =
Operations user can override the contract-level delivery setting, and the s=
ystem follows the override for that contract. <a class=3D"external-link" hr=
ef=3D"https://helpsystemsllc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/leah_guenther_helps=
ystems_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=3D%7BA844EC40-080D-4A98-90A9-E6B6=
4BD505AB%7D&amp;file=3DRenewals%20Requirement%20Gathering%20-%20Salesforce.=
docx&amp;action=3Ddefault&amp;mobileredirect=3Dtrue" rel=3D"nofollow">[Rene=
wals R...Salesforce | Word]</a></p></li>
</ul>
